# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — LEASEPROOF
## Property Inspection, Rental Handover & Condition Documentation Platform

Act as a senior software engineer, real estate technology product architect, JavaScript developer, and premium SaaS UI/UX designer.

Build a complete, fully functional web application named **LeaseProof**.

**Tagline: Document Every Detail. Protect Every Handover.**

LeaseProof is a property inspection and rental handover management platform designed for landlords, tenants, property managers, and real estate agencies.

The application helps users register properties, perform room-by-room inspections, capture photographic evidence, document property conditions, compare move-in and move-out inspections, record damages, and generate professional handover reports.

IMPORTANT:
Build the complete working application, not just a static UI prototype.

Every major feature, form, button, calculation, and navigation item must work.

