9. MOVE-IN INSPECTION
==================================================

Create a dedicated move-in inspection workflow.

When a tenant moves into a property:

1. Select the property.
2. Create a move-in inspection.
3. Inspect each room.
4. Record item conditions.
5. Capture photographs.
6. Add notes.
7. Record existing damages.
8. Review inspection completeness.
9. Save the inspection.
10. Generate a move-in condition report.

The system should preserve the original move-in record.

Do not allow accidental modification of an already finalized report.

If a report needs correction, create a documented amendment instead of silently replacing the original record.

